OL,3,GNEWSAFlats evacuated as car hits
OL,4,Ashopfront and catches fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been evacuated from
OL,7,Fflats above a row of shops after a car
OL,8,Fhit a shopfront and then caught fire.
OL,10,FEast Sussex Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fsaid it was called to Sutton Road in
OL,12,FSeaford at about 02:25 BST, where the
OL,13,Fvehicle fire later spread to the shops.
OL,15,FThe fire service said residents were
OL,16,Ftold to leave their homes while crews
OL,17,Ftackled the blaze, which was
OL,18,Fextinguished shortly before 04:00.
OL,20,FSussex Police said it was searching for
OL,21,Fthe vehicle's driver and appealed for
OL,22,Fwitnesses to get in touch.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
